WEBVTT

00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:03.770
Everyone, Kaleido Star is about to start.

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:06.540
When you watch Kaleido Star,
please keep your room brightly lit,

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:09.530
and sit as far from the TV as you can.

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:14.820
Well, well, well.
Have you ever skated before?

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:18.620
Skating on the ice smoothly,
skate and turn... Isn't it so cool?

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:21.890
This time, I'm making the
first attempt of my life, but...

00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:23.630
Oh my! It's super difficult.

00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:27.100
Since I'm very good at in-line skating,
I thought I would be all right.

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:28.500
But I just keep falling down
and running into things,

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.230
and it seems I keep saying things like "Ouch!"

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:32.770
But, unless I'm able to do this,
I'm gonna be beat by May.

00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:35.570
I can't back down now, either!

00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:37.730
I can't! I can't!

00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:47.950
<i>Tattoo Kiss hajimari wa aka to kuro no Passion</i>

00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:47.950
<i>Tattoo Kiss, the beginning is
red and black passions</i>

00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:55.260
<i>Toki ni urahara na kokoro o tayori ni</i>

00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:55.260
<i>Sometimes, we rely on our contrary hearts</i>

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:56.360
<i>Tattoo Kiss kirifuda wa mirai o kaeru Mission</i>

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:56.360
<i>Tattoo Kiss, the last resort is a
mission which changes the future</i>

00:00:56.360 --> 00:01:02.020
<i>Tattoo Kiss kirifuda wa mirai o kaeru Mission</i>

00:00:56.360 --> 00:01:02.020
New Wings

00:00:56.360 --> 00:01:02.020
<i>Tattoo Kiss, the last resort is a
mission which changes the future</i>

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:09.970
<i>Koi ni aimai na kotae wa iranai</i>

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:09.970
<i>There is no place for ambiguous answers in love</i>

00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:17.450
<i>Arienai genjitsu minai furi shite mo Bet</i>

00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:17.450
<i>Even while pretending not to see the
impossible reality, we bet</i>

00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:23.710
<i>Egatai shinjitsu Can U feel me now?</i>

00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:23.710
<i>Hard to obtain truth. Can you feel me now?</i>

00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:28.260
<i>Nesshiyasui jibun ni Say What?</i>

00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:28.260
<i>Say what to myself who gets excited easily?</i>

00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:31.620
<i>Tomadou iibun</i>

00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:31.620
<i>I'm confused, what to say</i>

00:01:33.230 --> 00:01:40.840
<i>Dreamin' samenai yume ochiteku sadame</i>

00:01:33.230 --> 00:01:40.840
<i>Dreamin' the never-waking dream,
the falling fate</i>

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:46.600
<i>Don't stop lovin' Can't stop lovin' U
Ya ya ya</i>

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:46.600
<i>Don't stop lovin' Can't stop lovin' you
Ya ya ya</i>

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:55.950
<i>Believe in U hikikae ni subete ushinatte mo</i>

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:55.950
<i>I believe in you even if I lose everything for it</i>

00:01:55.950 --> 00:02:01.480
<i>Still lovin' can't stop lovin' U
No no no</i>

00:01:55.950 --> 00:02:01.480
<i>Still lovin' Can't stop lovin' you
No no no</i>

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:08.090
<i>Tattoo Kiss</i>

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:08.090
<i>Tattoo Kiss</i>

00:02:12.630 --> 00:02:17.070
Anyone who stands on the top
will aim to be a real star.

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:22.210
But nobody has reached that top yet.

00:02:22.210 --> 00:02:24.080
A real star...

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:25.210
That's right.

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:31.290
They say that the hearts of all people
who see that performance will be one.

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:36.350
But even I don't know what kind of
performance that is.

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:39.730
Sora, surpass me.

00:02:39.730 --> 00:02:42.400
What? I can't...

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:44.500
You can.

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:46.870
And please be a star.

00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:51.940
Show me you can be a real Kaleido Star.

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:53.170
When you become a real star,

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:57.270
I'm sure Kaleido Stage will spread its
wings wide again too.

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:02.320
Miss Layla entrusted me with Kaleido Stage,

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:06.620
and I still can't meet her
expectations at all, and yet...

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:09.450
Not only that, because of me...

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:15.760
Ultimately, it means Layla Hamilton
was also a lukewarm performer like that.

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:18.600
For him to say that about Miss Layla...

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:24.670
Anyway, I will work hard in order to be
acknowledged by Mr. Leon as his partner.

00:03:24.670 --> 00:03:26.230
That's the only thing I can do.

00:03:26.610 --> 00:03:33.980
One day, I'll be sure, by all means, to make him
take back what he said about Miss Layla.

00:03:36.050 --> 00:03:36.350
Amazing Match on Ice

00:03:36.350 --> 00:03:39.090
Amazing Match on Ice

00:03:36.350 --> 00:03:39.090
"Amazing Match on Ice"

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:41.990
Amazing Match on Ice

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:45.990
These are my thoughts, such as they are,
after observing you all this time.

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:49.560
Maybe I've depressed you, talking about this
at length first thing in the morning, but...

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:50.470
Sora!

00:03:50.470 --> 00:03:51.370
Yes.

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:52.730
Oh, good morning, Ken.

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:55.270
Good morning.

00:03:55.270 --> 00:03:59.370
That is, were you listening
to what I was saying...

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:00.240
Huh? Were you saying something?

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:02.840
Oh, well... If you're not concerned...

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:04.850
I guess it... might be fine...

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:06.470
Really? Then, bye.

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:10.040
You don't have much presence...

00:04:11.550 --> 00:04:14.520
But in a sense, that could also
make you a gag character.

00:04:15.660 --> 00:04:16.990
Hey, Ken.

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:18.490
What?

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:19.760
Do you want to pair with me?

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:20.800
No.

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:22.730
Have you seen May?

00:04:22.730 --> 00:04:26.200
It seems she didn't come to the meeting
for the town girls' roles.

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.240
Oh, really?

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:29.570
It's a minor part,

00:04:29.570 --> 00:04:34.130
but I thought she'd be all excited because she's
been granted special permission to perform.

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:37.440
Well, May might not be that kind of person.

00:04:37.780 --> 00:04:41.180
Then she could be in the middle of
special training under a mysterious master.

00:04:42.320 --> 00:04:43.280
Who knows?

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:46.390
Then she ran away with someone
tall, dark and handsome?

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:48.290
No, she's not that kind of person either...

00:04:49.590 --> 00:04:51.420
And I don't know what you're talking about.

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:54.860
Then I wonder what happened to her?

00:04:54.860 --> 00:04:55.890
Well...

00:04:56.830 --> 00:04:58.200
Leon!

00:04:58.200 --> 00:04:58.800
Who's that?

00:04:58.800 --> 00:04:59.030
She's a newcomer, isn't she?

00:04:58.800 --> 00:04:59.030
Who's that?

00:04:59.030 --> 00:05:00.100
She's a newcomer, isn't she?

00:05:00.100 --> 00:05:02.160
She just called him by his first name.

00:05:02.770 --> 00:05:04.140
May...

00:05:04.140 --> 00:05:07.640
May, all cast members who play town girls
are in the meeting room and...

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:09.440
It's got nothing to do with me!

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:11.870
She's at it again.

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:14.750
Leon, come with me right now.

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:17.290
What? Right now?

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:20.020
I'll show you what I'm like when I really shine.

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:30.030
What's she trying to do this time?

00:05:30.030 --> 00:05:31.100
Who knows?

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:33.360
She said she'd show him how she looks
when she really shines...

00:05:34.170 --> 00:05:36.170
But why ice skating?

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:37.340
Isn't that May?

00:05:37.340 --> 00:05:38.370
Yes, it is.

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:40.240
Long time no see.

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:10.910
So, May is good at skating. I didn't know.

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:12.810
The way she skates, she's more than
"good at skating."

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:19.140
The ice fairy, May Wong is back.

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:31.490
It's Mina Murray.

00:06:32.590 --> 00:06:36.160
May's playing the role of
Dracula's leading lady, Mina Murray.

00:06:36.730 --> 00:06:38.300
But, if I remember right,

00:06:38.300 --> 00:06:41.540
isn't Mina Murray supposed to do
a Screw Spin using a trapeze?

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:42.570
Yes.

00:06:42.570 --> 00:06:45.660
Even if she is good at skating,
it has nothing to do with the role.

00:06:46.270 --> 00:06:47.240
But...

00:06:48.210 --> 00:06:50.270
It's true, she's really shining.

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:18.710
You're the best, May!

00:07:18.710 --> 00:07:19.670
Beautiful!

00:07:24.980 --> 00:07:28.620
So, this is how May really shines.

00:07:28.620 --> 00:07:32.020
Mia, change the script.

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:34.150
Yes. How?

00:07:35.190 --> 00:07:37.460
Dracula will be done on ice.

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:38.360
What?

00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:38.430
On skates?

00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:38.430
What?

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:39.290
On skates?

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:45.030
Then you're saying that you're going
to choose me as your partner. Right?

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:52.430
Are you telling me that I should be satisfied
with the way you performed right now?

00:07:55.610 --> 00:07:57.610
What don't you like?!

00:07:57.610 --> 00:08:00.380
The performance I did right now was perfect!

00:08:00.380 --> 00:08:05.880
You may be satisfied, but I was bored.
It didn't excite me at all.

00:08:07.060 --> 00:08:10.350
I just like the idea of skating.

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:16.600
So in the end, we're going without Mina Murray
and now he wants it on skates?

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:19.500
This is deviating further and further
from my original image.

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:21.140
There, there...

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:22.900
Skating...

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:27.880
All right! I'm going to challenge you at skating!

00:08:27.880 --> 00:08:28.910
What?

00:08:28.910 --> 00:08:33.350
'Cause in order to play Mina Murray,
I have to master skating, right?

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:35.150
Are you stupid?

00:08:35.150 --> 00:08:38.190
Do you think you'll be able
to skate better than me?

00:08:38.190 --> 00:08:40.560
Uh, well...

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:43.790
Unless I try it, I won't know.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:45.090
Also, I want to give it a try.

00:08:54.140 --> 00:08:55.970
She's not bad.

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:58.170
After all, she's good at in-line skating.

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:00.440
What? What?!

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:01.530
I can't turn!

00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:03.740
Oh, my goodness.

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:09.470
This could be pretty difficult...
This could... This could...

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:14.080
All of a sudden, her performance
level dropped way too much.

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:16.090
It's not like you.

00:09:16.090 --> 00:09:18.150
But I have to get used to it first...

00:09:18.630 --> 00:09:19.490
Straighten your back.

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:20.500
Yes!

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:21.790
Put your feet sideways.

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:23.320
Open your legs.

00:09:24.170 --> 00:09:25.600
Keep your back straight.

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:27.000
Oh! I'm going to fall.

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:27.870
Huh?

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:28.800
I'm not falling.

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:34.710
Unlike in-line skates, on ice skates
you slip less if you slant them.

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:36.110
I see...

00:09:36.110 --> 00:09:37.340
Hold that pose.

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:40.680
I'm skating?

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:43.950
It seems you have talent.
So I think you'll improve quickly.

00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:45.010
Really?

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:46.520
Who's that?

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:47.580
I have no idea.

00:09:49.090 --> 00:09:51.960
My name's Meryl. I work here.

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:54.130
You must be from Kaleido Stage, right?

00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:56.190
Yes, my name is Sora Naegino.

00:09:56.430 --> 00:09:59.200
Are you competing with May for a role?

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:01.500
What? Do you know May?

00:10:02.270 --> 00:10:03.440
Yes.

00:10:03.440 --> 00:10:07.710
I saw her skating for the first time in a while,
but her skating is not rusty at all.

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:11.010
That girl could shine even on the
international stage. It's such a waste.

00:10:11.480 --> 00:10:13.410
Shine on the international stage?

00:10:13.410 --> 00:10:14.380
That's right.

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:21.620
When May came to this skating rink,
she was only three or four years old.

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:25.360
Once I saw her,

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:28.820
I knew May had the talent
to compete on the world level.

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:31.200
If she kept practicing regularly,

00:10:31.200 --> 00:10:33.970
I thought even getting
a gold medal could be a reality.

00:10:33.970 --> 00:10:35.700
But...

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:42.340
She had another dream... A big dream.

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:51.320
Amazing...

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:53.010
Miss Layla is amazing.

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:58.780
One day, I want to appear on the
Kaleido Stage with Miss Layla.

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:01.560
One day...

00:11:02.830 --> 00:11:04.800
Her desire was very strong.

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:10.540
No matter how hard I tried to persuade her,
she didn't listen to me in the end.

00:11:10.540 --> 00:11:14.300
May was that enthralled by Miss Layla?

00:11:15.910 --> 00:11:17.750
What's he saying is wrong?

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:19.750
What's missing?

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:22.150
Doesn't Leon like me?!

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:45.270
May told me clearly.

00:11:45.270 --> 00:11:50.010
"l like skating, but I like Kaleido Stage more."

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:57.620
I want to be a Kaleido Star,
a real Kaleido Star, like Miss Layla.

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:03.490
Sorry. I'm very sorry, Meryl.

00:12:04.930 --> 00:12:08.360
I probably won't ever wear these shoes again.

00:12:08.360 --> 00:12:12.930
After three years, once I finish school,
I will audition.

00:12:12.930 --> 00:12:18.270
And, one day, I'll definitely stand on
the same stage as Miss Layla.

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:20.570
When that happens, please come to see me.

00:12:26.080 --> 00:12:28.170
May's the same as me.

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:33.220
She's been inspired by Miss Layla's
performance on Kaleido Stage like I was.

00:12:33.220 --> 00:12:37.360
Yet, Miss Layla retired.

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:43.130
So she must hate me because I performed
the legendary great maneuver with her.

00:12:43.830 --> 00:12:47.060
If you want to make friends with her,
you have only one way to do it.

00:12:47.970 --> 00:12:48.940
How?

00:12:50.300 --> 00:12:52.830
Take a bath together immediately, and...

00:12:53.610 --> 00:12:57.580
Would you mind not joking like that
when I'm seriously distressed?

00:12:57.580 --> 00:13:00.920
Joking? I'm not joking.

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:02.940
I seriously want you, May and l...

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:05.420
Sora? I'm sorry.

00:13:05.420 --> 00:13:06.680
Please forgive me.

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:13.460
In order not to disappoint May,
I have to work hard and beat her.

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:15.690
Isn't it right, Miss Layla?

00:13:22.470 --> 00:13:26.240
According to my dad, the rink will be
ready for skating after three days.

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:32.550
Then, Leon actually skates, and he is supposed
to set the contents of the show in stone.

00:13:32.550 --> 00:13:35.720
So three days from now will be
their last chance to pass the test?

00:13:35.720 --> 00:13:36.550
Yes.

00:13:36.550 --> 00:13:39.150
In three days?! Don't be rash!

00:13:39.150 --> 00:13:40.420
Please!

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:43.160
Please teach me to skate in three days.

00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:46.720
I have to beat May. By all means.

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:50.990
You sound serious.

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:53.960
Okay. I'll teach you.

00:13:59.840 --> 00:14:03.540
I guess I have no choice but to
ask Meryl to help me after all.

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:04.940
Meryl!

00:14:05.350 --> 00:14:07.450
Oh, May.

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:09.050
Meryl is somewhere around the rink.

00:14:09.050 --> 00:14:10.380
What?

00:14:10.380 --> 00:14:12.620
Not like that. Do it stronger.

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:13.680
Yes.

00:14:19.930 --> 00:14:20.890
Meryl!

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:23.330
What is this?!

00:14:23.330 --> 00:14:25.370
Why are you teaching Sora?

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:27.130
Is something wrong?

00:14:28.070 --> 00:14:29.770
I asked her.

00:14:29.770 --> 00:14:33.140
Because I want the skill to
compete with you on equal terms.

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:37.240
May. If you let your guard down,
you will be surpassed by Sora.

00:14:38.650 --> 00:14:41.880
Surpassed by Sora? ME?!

00:14:42.380 --> 00:14:43.720
That's right.

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:45.850
Sora is gifted.

00:14:45.850 --> 00:14:48.290
She could be better than you.

00:14:50.090 --> 00:14:53.220
And I'm the one teaching her, after all.

00:14:57.970 --> 00:15:02.340
Nonsense! I can't lose in skating.

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:06.400
And I'll never lose to somebody like Sora.
I will never lose! Never!

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:14.380
No, do it more boldly!

00:15:14.380 --> 00:15:15.250
Yes!

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:17.240
They're amazing, huh?

00:15:21.320 --> 00:15:23.520
May's amazing. But I'm sure I'm
going to catch up with her.

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:27.390
For May and for Miss Layla!

00:15:32.730 --> 00:15:35.870
Sora, you have a weakness.

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:38.770
You're probably not aware of it, but...

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:42.780
Sora's so amazing. She's improving so quickly.

00:15:42.780 --> 00:15:44.770
She could come from behind and win.

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:54.550
How is your physical condition?

00:15:55.160 --> 00:15:57.250
Right now I'm in top condition.

00:15:57.630 --> 00:15:59.530
I see. In that case, that's fine.

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:03.230
Sora has a weakness.

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:05.660
But she doesn't have enough time
to overcome it in two days.

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:10.470
I don't think I should say
anything unnecessary right now.

00:16:22.550 --> 00:16:24.140
It all finally happens tomorrow.

00:16:24.590 --> 00:16:26.710
I'm sure Sora is able to pull it off.

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:31.890
Oh, please let him decide
to let Sora play Mina Murray.

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:40.430
In only three days, she's gotten this good.

00:16:40.870 --> 00:16:42.890
How is that possible...

00:16:44.570 --> 00:16:48.030
In order to be accepted by Leon,
technique itself is not good enough.

00:16:48.640 --> 00:16:51.700
I can't say Sora's performance is perfect,

00:16:52.350 --> 00:16:56.370
but there's a possibility that she could win.

00:16:57.790 --> 00:17:02.290
I will not... I will not let it happen.

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:03.920
I will not beaten by you.

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:15.130
I've not seen this kind of desperation
in May for a long time.

00:17:21.910 --> 00:17:24.110
Wow! You're pretty good, Sora.

00:17:24.110 --> 00:17:25.650
She is something else.

00:17:25.650 --> 00:17:27.710
Go, Sora!

00:17:28.950 --> 00:17:31.080
In only three days, what could have changed?

00:17:36.420 --> 00:17:39.390
The composure she had at that time
is completely gone?

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:41.830
Because of Sora?

00:17:43.030 --> 00:17:44.330
Interesting.

00:18:26.770 --> 00:18:29.540
If you want to be my partner, come up here.

00:18:30.410 --> 00:18:31.540
Yes!

00:18:31.780 --> 00:18:34.150
I can't believe he jumped over there.

00:18:34.150 --> 00:18:35.880
It's a superhuman feat.

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:37.680
Will Sora be okay?

00:18:38.920 --> 00:18:41.480
What is he thinking?

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:47.290
In terms of the degree of perfection,
May is better.

00:18:47.290 --> 00:18:50.400
Sora's performance looks like
she just learned how to skate.

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:53.630
When it comes to perfection,
it's not worth talking about.

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:55.090
But...

00:18:55.770 --> 00:18:58.370
She possesses something.

00:18:58.370 --> 00:19:00.100
I don't know what it is...

00:19:01.180 --> 00:19:03.010
But I definitely felt it then.

00:19:03.710 --> 00:19:06.480
Something strange... Something.

00:19:07.650 --> 00:19:11.980
What the hell is it?

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:22.420
I will not be beat by her!

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:24.790
I will not lose! Never!

00:19:29.940 --> 00:19:30.770
At the same time?

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:31.670
Sora!

00:19:41.220 --> 00:19:42.180
They can't reach...

00:20:22.760 --> 00:20:24.830
I lost.

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:28.390
I couldn't be acknowledged by Mr. Leon.

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:33.520
Sorry, Miss Layla. Sorry, Mia.

00:20:34.470 --> 00:20:36.500
She lost...

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:38.170
Why did he pick May?

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:39.670
Sora...

00:20:39.670 --> 00:20:42.540
Does this mean May won Leon's heart?

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:48.850
Leon...

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:50.910
You're going to play Mina Murray.

00:20:54.560 --> 00:20:55.540
Yes.

00:20:58.560 --> 00:21:00.830
It won't do me any good
to keep moping about this.

00:21:00.830 --> 00:21:07.530
The thing I have to do now is to make
Dracula the best show.

00:21:33.230 --> 00:21:34.490
Niagara Diving!

00:21:47.540 --> 00:21:49.010
I can hear it.

00:21:49.010 --> 00:21:53.040
I can hear the applause they're giving us.

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:58.050
May, you found a good rival.

00:21:59.290 --> 00:22:01.050
Grand Screw Jump!

00:22:01.760 --> 00:22:03.790
Here!

00:22:03.790 --> 00:22:06.350
Sora, you have a mysterious power.

00:22:07.460 --> 00:22:11.520
Somehow, people around you are
influenced by you, and start shining.

00:22:12.130 --> 00:22:16.970
But, in order for you to shine,
you have to overcome your weakness.

00:22:18.410 --> 00:22:21.170
The fight between you two is just beginning.

00:22:21.780 --> 00:22:27.980
But I'm looking forward to finding out
which one of you becomes a real star.

00:22:31.750 --> 00:22:35.020
